                  Best Overall Epoxy
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="p-6">
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                  Rust-Oleum EpoxyShield remains the most widely used and consistently reliable water-based epoxy coating on the consumer market. Its position as the default recommendation for first-time garage floor coatings is well-earned: the kit is complete, the instructions are genuinely clear and accurate, and the product's performance over the first three to five years of a residential garage is reliably strong. In our testing, EpoxyShield showed excellent adhesion over properly prepared concrete, good chemical resistance against the standard palette of garage contaminants — motor oil, brake fluid, transmission fluid, and road salt — and a consistent, attractive finish that maintained its appearance well over the six-month test period. The water-based formula's low-odor application is a meaningful practical advantage for homeowners working in attached garages adjacent to living space, and the 2–3 hour pot life provides a forgiving working window for inexperienced applicators. The limitations of the water-based chemistry are real — the thinner film build means this coating is not the choice for a workshop floor under heavy use — but for its intended application as a residential parking and light-use coating, EpoxyShield does exactly what it promises.
                </p>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
                  <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-xl p-4">
                    <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-green-700 mb-3">Pros</p>
                    <ul class="space-y-2">
                      <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-green-800"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Most complete DIY kit on the market — everything included</li>
                      <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-green-800"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Low odor — safe for enclosed garage application</li>
                      <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-green-800"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Forgiving pot life and application technique for first-timers</li>
                    </ul>
