                    <ul class="space-y-2">
                      <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-red-800"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>Yellows in UV-exposed areas within 2–3 years</li>
                      <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-red-800"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>Thinner film build than higher-solids alternatives</li>
                    </ul>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100">
                  <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 mb-1">Verdict</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-900 font-bold">The benchmark water-based epoxy. Reliable, accessible, and delivers consistently good results for the majority of residential garage applications.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Product 2: RockSolid -->
          <div id="rocksolid-coating" class="scroll-mt-24 mt-10">
            <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
              <div class="bg-gray-900 px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="bg-[#FF4500] text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-black">2</span>
                  <div>
