              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">This is your first epoxy project, your budget is limited, or you want to see how a coated floor performs before committing to a premium system. <strong>Recommended: Rust-Oleum EpoxyShield 2-Part Kit.</strong> The complete kit, clear instructions, forgiving application window, and proven track record make it the right learning project. Even if you coat over it with a better system in five years, you'll have gained experience that makes the next application much more successful.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="font-black text-lg text-gray-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#FF4500] font-black">05</span> Rental Property Garage
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">You need a clean, improved floor at minimal cost with the least possible downtime and preparation complexity. Longevity is less important than appearance, cost, and ease of recoating between tenants. <strong>Recommended: KILZ Over Armor.</strong> The low cost, no-mix application, and sufficient improvement over bare concrete make it the practical choice for a rental context where maximizing investment return per square foot matters more than long-term coating performance.</p>
